Multi-Repo Ownership Document

# Multi-Repo Workspace Guidance

## Preferred Root

Open:

Fabric-Platform

Do Not Open Individual Child Repositories
unless performing isolated maintenance.

## Ownership

Cross-cutting changes belong to:

Fabric-Platform

Examples:

* Shared skills
* Shared commands
* Shared hooks
* MCP configuration

## Child Repository Responsibilities

Bronze:
Bronze ingestion only.

Silver:
Transformation only.

Gold:
Reporting only.

Shared-Library:
Reusable components only.

## Conflict Resolution

Root repository AGENTS.md is authoritative.

Child repositories may extend instructions
but must not override platform standards.
